@startuml compliance_pipeline
' Compliance Pipeline - backs docs/superpowers/specs/2026-04-20-repo-compliance-design.md.
' Activity diagram of the full /repo-audit coordinator flow: parallel domain agents,
' override suppression, interactive vs. scheduled branching, and retrospective.
' Last verified: 2026-04-23 against .claude/skills/repo-compliance/ and agent files.

title Repo Compliance Pipeline

skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #fefefe
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Roboto

start

:User invokes /repo-audit [path] [--scheduled];

:Coordinator loads\nstandards-manifest.yaml\ncompliance-overrides.md\ncompliance-exclusions.yaml;

note right
  Exclusions list repos skipped
  entirely in scheduled sweeps.
  Overrides suppress approved
  exceptions per check ID.
end note

fork
  :repo-foundations-auditor\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - -\nFOUND-001..011\nFile presence, .gitignore,\npyproject.toml metadata;
fork again
  :python-toolchain-auditor\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - -\nTOOL-001..012\nDev deps, Ruff rule set,\nBasedPyright config, qlty;
fork again
  :pre-commit-auditor\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - -\nPC-001..010\nHook inventory, SHA pins,\nno-em-dash hook;
fork again
  :ossf-compliance-auditor\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - -\nOSSF-001..005\nSCORECARD checks\nCI-017 branch protection\nLive Scorecard + Badge APIs;
fork again
  :claude-docs-auditor\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - -\nCLAUDE-001..007\nCLAUDE.md sections,\nRAD cross-references,\nem-dash scan (delegates\nto writing-style-editor);
fork again
  :ci-compliance\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - -\nCI-001..017\nWorkflow inventory,\ngate jobs, SHA pins,\nbranch protection contexts;
fork again
  :general-compliance-auditor\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - -\nunclassified candidates\nReceives covered check IDs\nas negative filter; audits\ngaps domain agents cannot see;
end fork

:Merge all FINDING blocks\nApply override suppression\nSort: critical -> important -> suggested -> unclassified;

if (--scheduled mode?) then (yes)
  :Write per-repo compliance report\ndocs/compliance-reports/<repo>.md;
  :Emit summary to session output;
  note right
    Scheduled sweeps produce
    report-only output.
    No code changes are made.
  end note
else (no, interactive)
  :Present findings to user\n(grouped by severity);
  repeat
    :User selects findings\nto remediate or dismiss;
    :Domain agents execute\napproved fixes in-repo;
  repeat while (findings remain?) is (yes)
  ->no;
  :Commit changes and\nopen pull request;
endif

:compliance-retrospective\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - -\nPattern detection across session findings\nGroup unclassified candidates by pattern\nFlag checks appearing in 3+ repos\nWrite lessons-learned doc\nPropose manifest entries as YAML snippets;

stop

@enduml
